    "html_url": "https://github.com/nelsong6/shows/commit/77d6a6cba14101a0a28c45021bd932b94b86f832",
    "message": "desktop: fix pin desync, fullscreen/maximize pin corruption, drag dead-ends\n\nPlain pin/unpin \"didn't stay toggled\" and the window could lose its only\ndrag handle. Root cause: pin state lived in three stores that could drift\nand never re-sync — window_on_top is echoed only on change, unlike the\nheartbeat-backed pause/volume controls the pattern was copied from.\n\nFrontend (App.tsx):\n- One optimistic value (`pinned`/`onTopRef`) now drives BOTH the button\n  highlight and the next-command direction, so the button responds\n  instantly instead of waiting a status round-trip (the lag is what made\n  it feel like the toggle \"didn't take\").\n- Roll the optimistic value back to host truth when a /stay-on-top POST\n  fails (and surface a toast), so a lost command can't strand the toggle\n  direction against the idempotent host.\n- Gate the pin-mode surface drag on the host-confirmed window_on_top\n  (hostOnTopRef) — the same truth the host's nc_hit uses — so the window\n  always has exactly one drag handle, never zero.\n- Auto-hide gate uses optimistic displayPaused (no flash on Space).\n\nHost (compositor.rs):\n- Fullscreen exit re-applies HWND_TOPMOST from the live is_on_top, so a\n  pin done while fullscreen no longer leaves the titlebar gone forever.\n- Pin entry clears WS_MAXIMIZE (SW_RESTORE) before the aspect snap, so\n  maximized-\u003epin keeps working resize borders.\n- WM_GETMINMAXINFO floors the window above its own chrome width.\n- After a pin-mode modal move loop, nudge the overlay so the control bar\n  (the only mouse unpin affordance in pin mode) reveals.\n- Persist the pre-pin windowed rect, not the aspect-snapped pin rect.\n\nDocs: add the \"Pin toggle: one click, one command\" contract section that\ndesktop-shell.md already linked to; refresh ADR-0001's outstanding note.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e",
    "node_id": "C_kwDOS5KECdoAKDc3ZDZhNmNiYTE0MTAxYTBhMjhjNDUwMjFiZDkzMmI5NGI4NmY4MzI",
